# A hosted table on the local platform, the host's side (alice, desktop):
# Hosted Play, Host a table, wait for bob, Start round (two AI seats fill the
# table), then play by keys (→ choose, Enter play, D draw; Enter declares the
# focused best suit) to the result server.js records.
# viewport 1280x720@1
until 900 =Hosted Play
frames 30
click =Hosted Play
until 300 =Host a table
frames 10
click =Host a table
until 600 =Start round
frames 10
until 3000 2 seated
frames 20
save online-host-lobby
click =Start round
until 1200 (your turn)
frames 30
save online-host-play
repeat 4000 until =Round over
  key ArrowRight 1
  frames 3
  key Enter 1
  frames 12
  key KeyD 1
  frames 25
end
frames 30
save online-host-results
expect result recorded by the StarHermit server
